      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  -- every 'USE' executes a corresponding C subroutine.
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  USE reader AS reader
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |    DATA
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      xdata[1] := total_knt
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      xdata[2] := stoptime
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      xdata[3] := channel_id
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |    INPUT
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      -- Passes the values 'wanted' to xin[1..3] of C subroutine.
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      xin[1..3] := wanted[1..3]
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      xin[4] := t
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |      xin[5] := curr_knt
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  ENDUSE
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |  o2 := t
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |ENDEXEC
      Another ordinary MODELS data card.          |ENDMODEL
